{"step_index":106,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T14:02:56Z","input_tokens":2179,"cache_read_tokens":104657,"output_tokens":4716,"thinking":"The `InvoiceViewer.js` component needs to handle toggling between different invoice display modes based on file upload presence. It must also dynamically update to reflect all user edits across key invoice fields in real time. Ensuring that interactive bounding boxes are synced with the invoice items in real time, along with allowing zoom functionality, will provide a complete invoice viewing experience.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"// Component: High-fidelity Realistic Indian Tax Invoice Viewer with Real-Time Document Toggle\\nimport { formatRupees } from \\\"../utils/auditEngine.js\\\";\\n\\nexport function renderInvoiceViewer(container, invoice, audit, options = {}) {\\n  const { onSelectItem, selectedItemId } = options;\\n\\n  const hasUploadedFile = !!invoice.uploaded_file_url;\\n  // Local view mode state attached to container dataset\\n  const currentMode = container.dataset.viewMode || (hasUploadedFile ? \\\"photo\\\" : \\\"digital\\\");\\n\\n  container.innerHTML = `\\n    <div class=\\\"relative bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden select-none\\\">\\n      <!-- Toolbar Header -->\\n      <div class=\\\"bg-slate-100/90 px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-2\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full ${audit.hasTotalDiscrepancy ? 'bg-rose-500 animate-pulse' : 'bg-emerald-500'}\\\"></span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 tracking-wide uppercase\\\">\\n            ${currentMode === 'photo' ? 'Original Document Scan' : 'Live Tax Invoice Preview'}\\n          </span>\\n          <span class=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-mono\\\">(${invoice.invoice_no || \\\"Draft\\\"})</span>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"flex items-center space-x-1.5 text-xs\\\">\\n          ${hasUploadedFile ? `\\n            <div class=\\\"bg-slate-200/90 p-0.5 rounded-lg flex text-[10px] font-bold\\\">\\n              <button id=\\\"toggle-view-photo\\\" class=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded ${currentMode === 'photo' ? 'bg-white shadow-xs text-slate-900' : 'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900'}\\\">\\n                📷 Original Photo\\n              </button>\\n              <button id=\\\"toggle-view-digital\\\" class=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded ${currentMode === 'digital' ? 'bg-white shadow-xs text-slate-900' : 'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900'}\\\">\\n                📄 Digitized Parcha\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          `\n<truncated 14712 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"/Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/components/InvoiceViewer.js\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
