{"step_index":108,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T14:03:27Z","input_tokens":4785,"cache_read_tokens":106843,"output_tokens":10552,"thinking":"Initial hypothesis: user requires real-time calculations within an interactive line item interface for bill generation. The core features needed are immediate updates on keystrokes within input fields (Quantity, Rate, Billed Amount) and an \"Add Item\" button for new rows with default values. This will enable immediate subtotal, tax, and total calculation.\n\n\nThe design requires dynamic controls for line items, including deletion and real-time recalculation of subtotals and totals. Interactive elements for tax input and validation are necessary, including GSTIN validation with visual cues and error handling. Real-time discrepancy detection between declared and calculated totals with a one-click fix is planned.\n\nInteractive sliders for digital receipts ratio and annual turnover, impacting deemed net profit calculation, are also critical. Finally, adding quick-action buttons for sharing the dispute note via WhatsApp, copying the note, and generating a printable audit slip is the plan.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"// Component: Audit Scorecard & Interactive Line-Item Verification Panel\\nimport { formatRupees, round2 } from \\\"../utils/auditEngine.js\\\";\\n\\nexport function renderAuditScorecard(container, invoice, audit, options = {}) {\\n  const { \\n    onUpdateItem, \\n    onAddItem, \\n    onDeleteItem,\\n    onUpdateHeader,\\n    onAutoFixMath,\\n    onUpdateTaxSettings,\\n    onCopyNote, \\n    onOpenCaSlip, \\n    onBack, \\n    selectedItemId, \\n    taxData, \\n    onRefreshTaxAi \\n  } = options;\\n\\n  const isOvercharge = audit.hasTotalDiscrepancy;\\n  const isClean = audit.status === \\\"VERIFIED\\\";\\n  const isWarning = audit.status === \\\"REVIEW_NEEDED\\\";\\n\\n  const { audit_summary, calculated_tax, ai_suggestions } = taxData || {\\n    audit_summary: {\\n      total_turnover: 3600000,\\n      deemed_profit: 244800,\\n      eligible_itc: audit.gstinValid ? audit.totalTax : 0,\\n      disallowed_itc: !audit.gstinValid ? audit.totalTax : 0,\\n      invoices_missing_gstin: audit.gstinValid ? 0 : 1,\\n      digital_ratio: 0.60\\n    },\\n    calculated_tax: {\\n      recommended_form: \\\"ITR-4 (Presumptive Scheme - Sec 44AD)\\\",\\n      annual_turnover: 3600000,\\n      digital_percent: 60,\\n      cash_percent: 40,\\n      deemed_net_profit: 244800,\\n      estimated_tax_liability: 0,\\n      tax_regime: \\\"New Regime (Section 115BAC)\\\"\\n    },\\n    ai_suggestions: {\\n      suggestions: [\\n        \\\"Recommended ITR Form: File ITR-4 Sugam under Section 44AD presumptive scheme because your retail turnover is within ₹2-3 Crores, allowing you to declare deemed profit without maintaining formal books.\\\",\\n        audit.gstinValid \\n          ? `GST ITC Opportunity / Risk: You have ${formatRupees(audit.totalTax)} in eligible Input Tax Credit from this bill to directly offset your GST liability.`\\n          : `GST ITC Opportunity / Risk: Missing supplier GSTIN blocks ${formatRupees(audit.totalTax)} in Input Tax Credit. Request a valid GSTIN bill to avoid higher tax outgo.`,\\n        \\\"Advance Tax & Action Item: Remind yourself to pay 100% of your advance tax \n<truncated 32720 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"/Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/components/AuditScorecard.js\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
